5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’d like to understand how the current setup affects our daily interactions before we decide anything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very wise thought, Misaki. I worry about the morning rush, too. It feels a bit like a shoving match down there lately.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Honestly, I’m tired of everyone asking what it costs without checking. I want to know the real price of losing a spot.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I worry about who maintains this long-term. The last two roles we created just quietly disappeared.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I keep hearing the same spots always go to the same doors. Is that actually true, or just grumbling?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, that pattern is worth verifying. I want to see if the current layout is actually causing friction or just resentment.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I hope you can check that. I also want to see how the rain affects the bikes, as that worries me quite a bit.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, your maintenance worry is valid. I’m checking the ledger and the station park to see the actual financial stakes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"@May, I appreciate that. I will look into the treasurer’s file and the supplier’s frame to see the actual workload involved.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I’ll check the minutes and the sticker register to see if the grumbling matches reality.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll check the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account. I need to see how these arrangements actually sour relationships.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, that sounds very prudent. I will look into the morning departures and the rain exposure to see the daily reality.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’m already set on the ledger and the station park. I just want to see the real numbers before we start guessing.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I’ll examine the treasurer’s handover file and the supplier’s display frame. I need to know the true physical and administrative burden before we commit.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
