35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Nine complaints died out last year because no one was responsible. The block behind us lost two members to a monthly charge.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, that is quite worrying. I found that four mornings required shifting bikes, and the rain soaks the outer row.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@George, the station park costs 2,600 yen monthly with fourteen waiting. Our ledger is empty, so any capital work means a levy.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,George,,"@May, that waiting list is significant. The treasurer’s file shows three hours monthly just for current collections. Adding per-place billing would double that burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@May, the minutes confirm the grumbling! The same flats held the covered spots for five years with zero review.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, that confirms the resentment is real. But the block behind us shows that charging people can make them vanish from our community entirely.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, that is a heavy burden to carry for so long. I hope we can find a fairer way to share the dry spots.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Mio, five years without review is outrageous. But with an empty ledger, any new system needs a levy. Who pays for that?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,George,,"@May, the physical effort is manageable, but the paperwork is the real trap. I cannot take on another three hours monthly.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, the sticker register shows daily riders actually prefer paying over equal claims. So maybe the cost is worth it to them?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, that preference is interesting, but the block behind us shows the social cost. People stopped showing up entirely.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, I understand your worry. But seeing the rain and the shoving, I feel we must act. Perhaps a fairer rotation?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Mio, if they’d rather pay, that’s a clue. But with an empty ledger, who covers the setup costs?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,George,,"@Mio, that preference is noted. But the frame trial showed twenty seconds of lifting and bi-annual greasing. I cannot sustain that physical routine indefinitely.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I get the social risk. But if people want to pay, maybe we just need a system that doesn’t punish the quiet ones?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, I agree. We need a system that respects those preferences without isolating the others. Let’s see what options we have.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, I agree. We must protect our harmony. I hope the options balance fairness with kindness, so no one feels pushed away.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I hear you. But if the ledger is empty, who pays for the setup? I need to know the real cost before we commit.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,George,,"@May, the ledger is empty, yes. But the real cost is my time. I cannot sustain the paperwork or the physical lifting.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@May, the ledger is empty, but the daily riders said they’d pay. Maybe that covers the setup?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
